ter effects of being an ice demon  becoming a demon seems to increase  ferocity and strength  and includes abnormal freezing of the  skin too and a human body can't endure  that for long  this really is quite the concoction that  queen has released  so that even farther characters become a  way  bigger threat not only are they stronger  they become vessels for spreading the  ice demon  infection which can take out even the  strongest opponents  and then queen straight up says that  people who are infected will die  in an hour massively shortening the  window of hope  that the infected have it would be an  absolutely insane and tragic twist  if one of the straw hats was to get it  and queen just keeps being absolutely  brutal which not gonna lie  makes for a great antagonist he taunts  the infected laughing  and asking if these ice demons around  them bound for death were their friends  leaders and or subordinates and he says  make sure to kiss them goodbye but of  course anyone who did that would get  infected  as well and he just keeps laughing i  mean dude it is gonna feel really good  when queen gets his just desserts after  all of this  especially when he even treats his own  guys like this  you may think that queen is just willing  to sacrifice pleasures but he even makes  supernova scratchman  apu a target making his life way more  difficult  he supposedly throws him the one and  only antibody that exists in the world  and says that if anyone steals it from  the supernova it'll cost the supernova  his life i love how almost everyone is  freaking out but queen  is just having the time of his life  viewing it all as a live game show  it's almost like he's creating his own  version of the hunger games  and he says murder or betrayal anything  goes and he even wants to make sure our  guys have a chance to save themselves  so it's more interesting queen is pretty  much a mangaka in the manga  trying to make things as interesting and  intense as possible  and despit